  "description": "A true mixte frame with the double top tube/stays. Obviously offers lots of standover height and style as well. You’ll find the geometry is more sporty, than upright-comfy. Though it can be built up to suit either demeanor.\n\nDrop bars? Sure. Townie bars? Of course.\n\n132.5mm hub spacing to fit either road or MTB hubs\n\nRack and fender eyelets\n\n1-1/8\" size headtube\n\n42, 50, 54, 58, (no 62cm)\n\n42cm model uses 26\" wheels and 73mm reach brakes (like Tektro 556 or Rivendell Silvers) Max. tire width: 1.5\" with fenders",
